 *   measured in step A (or set by the player), else the fire rate x the
 *   line's own time span + 1, else the fire rate x how long Fire was held
 *   + 1; at most 100. The shots sit at equal ARC LENGTH along the line, or,
 *   when the line is timed cleanly (its times only rise, and its span agrees
 *   with the fire rate), at equal TIME.
